>品牌文化</li><li class="showMenu"><a href="./html/payment.html">基础支付</a></li><li><a href="./html/capital.html">资金管理</a></li><li class="showMenu"><a href="./html/solution.html">解决方案</a></li><li><a href="./html/join-us.html">加入我们</a></li></ul></div><div class="menu"><div class="menuContent"><div class="menuLogo"><div class="menuLogoImg"><img src="./images/ding.png" alt=""></div></div><div class="menuNav brand"><div class="menuNavList"><div class="menuItem"><p><a href="./html/group.html">集团介绍</a></p><p><a href="./html/reapal.html">融宝介绍</a></p><p><a href="html/reapal-history.html">融宝历史</a></p></div><div class="menuItem"><p><a href="./html/culture.html">融宝文化</a></p><p><a href="./html/contact.html">联系我们</a></p></div></div></div><div class="menuNav plan"><div class="menuNavList" style="padding-right:0;left:-100px;text-align:left"><div class="menuItem"><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution.html">厂商直供行业</a></p><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution1.html">电商行业资金及金融</a></p><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution2.html">分期消费资金管理</a></p></div><div class="menuItem"><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution3.html">基金行业</a></p><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution4.html">车金融</a></p><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution5.html">消费保险行业支付</a></p></div><div class="menuItem"><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution6.html">物流行业</a></p><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution7.html">教育行业</a></p><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution8.html">商圈资金管理及金融</a></p></div><div class="menuItem"><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution9.html">数字娱乐行业资金管理</a></p><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution10.html">O2O资金及金融</a></p><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution11.html">跨境支付</a></p></div><div class="menuItem"><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution12.html">网络货运行业解决方案</a></p><p class="planNav"><a href="./html/solution13.html">支付账户产品解决方案</a></p></div></div></div><div class="menuNav basis"><div class="menuNavList"><div class="menuItem"><p><a href="./html/payment-details.html">网银支付</a></p><p><a href="./html/payment-details2.html">快捷支付</a></p><p><a href="./html/payment-details3.html">融合付</a></p></div><div class="menuItem"><p><a href="./html/payment-details4.html">委托收款</a></p><p><a href="./html/payment-details5.html">委托付款</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="main"><div class="indexSwiper"><div class="swiper-container swiper-container-index" style="min-height:420px;overflow:hidden"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="swiperSlide2 swiperItem"></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="swiperSlide5 swiperItem"><div class="swiperSlideContent"><h4 class="title"><img src="images/pay4.png"></h4><a href="https://crm.reapal.com/" target="view_window"><button class="swiperSlideContentButton">商户登录</button></a></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="swiperSlide4 swiperItem"><div class="swiperSlideContent"><h4 class="title"><img src="images/pay2.png"></h4><p class="desc">多重风控策略，有效拦截风险交易；交易数据加密处理，避免数据泄露。</p><a href="https://crm.reapal.com/" target="view_window"><button class="swiperSlideContentButton">商户登录</button></a></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="swiperSlide1 swiperItem"><div class="swiperSlideContent"><h4 class="title"><img src="images/pay1.png"></h4><p class="desc">集多项国际标准安全认证于一身，金融级保护为客户信息安全保驾护航;先进加密技术与验证措施产品，更好地保护您账户安全;严谨的资金管理准则与风险控制体系，从制度上保证用户的资金安全不受侵害。</p><a href="https://crm.reapal.com/" target="view_window"><button class="swiperSlideContentButton">商户登录</button></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="content products"><div class="productsList" id="productsList"></div></div><div class="content basicData" id="basicData"><ul><li><div class="timer count-title" id="dailyAmount" data-to="79000"></div><p>日均交易金额</p></li><li><div class="timer count-title" id="withdrawalTime" data-to="150"></div><p>平均提现时间/秒</p></li><li><div id="orderNumber" class="timer count-title" data-to="200"></div><p>平均每秒订单数量</p></li><li><div id="cooperationAgency" class="timer count-title" data-to="750"></div><p>合作机构</p></li></ul></div><div class="content newsCenterMain" id="newsCenterMain"></div><div class="content partners"><div class="partnersMask"></div><div class="partnersContent"><div class="productsTitle"><div><span></span><storng style="color:#fff">合作伙伴</storng><span class="right"></span></div><p style="color:#fff">PARTNERS</p></div><div class="productsContentText"><div class="partnersText"><p>行业明星团队，荣程集团全力打造，历经 3 年积累打造专业的支付系统解决方案和基于交易数据的商业智能平台，历经 122个版本迭代升级，服务 70 多个行业近 4 万家企业客户，处理超过 50 亿笔订单。</p></div><div class="logoList"><div class="swiper-container-2"><div class="swiper-wrapper"></div></div><div class="partnersLogoButton"><span id="bank" class="active">银行</span> <span id="customer">客户</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="content operating"><div class="productsTitle"><div><span></span><storng>运营理念</storng><span class="right"></span></div><p>OPERATIONS</p></div><div class="operatingContent"><div><ul class="clear" style="display:inline-table"><li><div><img src="images/yunying.png" alt=""></div><h6>运营理念</h6><p>融宝人以服务商户为己任，为社会和客户持续创造价值，努力实现“打造百年绿色荣程”的集团企业愿景。</p></li><li><div><img src="images/fengkongmoshi.png" alt=""></div><h6>风控模式</h6><p>集多项国际标准安全认证于一身，金融级保护为客户信息安全保驾护航。</p></li><li><div><img src="images/anquanxinxi.png" alt=""></div><h6>安全信息</h6><p>我公司严格执行安全策略，通过非金融机构支付业务设施认证、ADSS认证等，并根据法律法规要求提供相应级别的安全防护能力，确保公司信息系统的安全，以更好的为广大客户提供安全的服务。</p></li><li><div><img src="images/shouhoufuwu.png" alt=""></div><h6>售后服务</h6><p>支持除正常工作日结算以外的周六日和节假日的结算，充分支持商户业务开展，独创7*24不间断服务。</p></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div id="warningPdf" class="warningPdf" style="display:none"><div class="iframeBox"><img src="./images/warning1.png" width="620" height="800" alt=""></div></div><div class="footer"><div class="backTop"><div class="backText">TOP</div><div class="backLine"></div></div><div class="link"><div class="linkItem"><p class="itemTitle">企业概况</p><ul class="itemUl"><li><a href="./html/group.html">集团介绍</a></li><li><